OL,3,GNEWSARobert Burns farm charity warns
OL,4,Amembers after cyberattack data breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity that runs a farmhouse where
OL,7,FRobert Burns wrote some of his most
OL,8,Ffamous works has warned members and
OL,9,Fdonors to be vigilant after a major
OL,10,Fdata breach.
OL,12,FThe Robert Burns Ellisland Trust is one
OL,13,Fof an estimated 1,500 charities that
OL,14,Fuses software provided by Beacon CRM
OL,15,Fwhich suffered a cyberattack at the end
OL,16,Fof July.
OL,18,FThe charity, which runs the Ellisland
OL,19,Ffarm near Dumfries, has now written to
OL,20,Fsupporters confirming that membership
OL,21,Fand contact details were stored on a
OL,22,Fdatabase that was penetrated.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
