OL,3,GNEWSARobert Burns farm charity warns
OL,4,Amembers after cyberattack data breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an email, it stressed that banking
OL,7,Fcard details were not stored with
OL,8,FBeacon CRM, but it warned that contact
OL,9,Finformation could be used by scammers.
